# Dev Notes 22 — Worker Layout Option C State Core v1

## Date

2026-06-05

## Branch

```text
worker-layout-option-c-state-core-v1
```

## Purpose

This branch is the first production-code slice after the Worker Layout Option C preflight branch.

It keeps `llama_worker/llama.mjs` as the stable worker entrypoint and composition root while extracting only the first owner/leaf pieces:

- worker state initialization and model-path resolution;
- worker lifecycle operation queue storage;
- prompt-abort error construction;
- worker outbound protocol message construction.

